### View all pets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets

### Get pet by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/21
### Update pet
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/21
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bruno",
  "species": "Dog",
  "age": 4,
  "ownerName": "Rahul"
}
### Update pet
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/24
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "zeero",
  "species": "dog",
  "age": 2,
  "ownerName": "kavi"
}
### Delete a pet
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/pets/20



